    {
      "parameters": {
        "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Email Template</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif;\n            color: #454748;\n            background-color: #F1F1F1;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n        .email-container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding-top: 16px;\n        }\n        .email-content {\n            width: 590px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            background-color: white;\n            padding: 16px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        .email-header img {\n            width: 590px;\n            height: 120px;\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n            border: 0;\n        }\n        .divider {\n            border-top: 1px solid #cccccc;\n            margin: 16px 0;\n        }\n        h3 {\n            color: #212529;\n            font-size: 16.9px;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n        p, ul {\n            margin: 0 0 12px;\n            font-size: 14px;\n        }\n        ul {\n            list-style-type: disc;\n            padding-left: 20px;\n        }\n        .footer {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            background-color: #F1F1F1;\n            padding: 8px;\n        }\n        .footer a {\n            color: #008f8c;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"email-container\">\n        <div class=\"email-content\">\n            <!-- Header -->\n            <div class=\"email-header\">\n                <img src=\"https://www.edvistas.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Parent-Pathways-Email-Header.jpg\" alt=\"Parent Pathways Email Header\">\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Order Confirmation -->\n            <div>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Order Confirmation</p>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">IS12345</p>\n                <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Order Details -->\n            <div>\n                <p>Hello Customer Name,</p>\n                <p>Thank you for purchasing the Parent Pathways Package! This exclusive offer is designed to support your child’s academic journey with tailored resources and tools to help them succeed.</p>\n\n                <h3>What to Expect:</h3>\n                <p>The Parent Pathways program, Powered by DataMate™, includes comprehensive assessments in both literacy & math that are aligned with New York state standards. These tools are tailored to help students practice key academic skills with confidence.</p>\n\n                <h3>Key Program Benefits:</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li><strong>Personalized Learning Insights</strong>: Track your child's reading comprehension and math progress through the DRP™ (Degrees of Reading Power) and DMP™ (Degrees of Math Power) assessments.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Instant Feedback</strong>: After each test, receive immediate results that provide insight into your child's strengths and improvement areas.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Familiar Tools</strong>: Resources that simulate real-world academic environments such as highlighters, rulers, and calculators are all provided in the software.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Accessibility Options</strong>: Includes text-to-speech functionality for students who benefit from auditory support.</li>\n                </ul>\n\n                <p>With Parent Pathways, you'll have a clearer view of your child's progress and areas where they may need additional support or advanced challenges.</p>\n                <p>For any questions or assistance, please reach out to us at <strong><a href=\"mailto:parentpathways@edvistas.com\">parentpathways@edvistas.com</a></strong> or call our help desk at <strong>518-691-3400</strong>.</p>\n\n                <p>Thank you for choosing Parent Pathways!</p>\n                <p>Warm regards,<br>The Parent Pathways Team</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Footer -->\n        <div class=\"footer\">\n            Sent by <a href=\"http://www.edvistas.com\" target=\"_blank\">Educational Vistas</a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
      },
